string_searchModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: String search and compare.
    Provides: sir_str_find(hay, needle, start) -> out First index at/after start, else null.
    Provides: sir_str_count(hay, needle) -> out Occurrence count.
    Provides: sir_str_eq(a, b) -> out Byte equality.
